# Raw eval artifacts stay local; only summarized reports are committed.
results/**/transcripts/
results/**/*.jsonl
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Published on the `eval-results` branch, untracked on main — same asymmetry
# as results/. A local run leaves these behind; they must never ride into a
# main-branch PR. eval.yml and the census Routine publish them with an
# explicit `git add -f` on the eval-results branch, which is what makes the
# asymmetry work rather than silently dropping them.
roster/
usage/
